  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Economic statistics an IT</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ekonomisk statistik o IT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kosovos statistikmyndighet (SOK) har efterfr&#xE5;gat st&#xF6;d fr&#xE5;n Sida och SCB f&#xF6;r samarbete inom statistikomr&#xE4;det ekonomisk statistik samt st&#xF6;d till uppbyggnad av myndighetens IT system. CB har tagit fram ett projektdokument d&#xE4;r de f&#xF6;resl&#xE5;r ett l&#xE5;ngsiktigt institutionssamarbete &#xF6;ver fyra till fem &#xE5;r. D&#xE5; flera faktorer &#xE4;r os&#xE4;kra i Kosovo har en detaljerad projektplan och budget tagits fram f&#xF6;r 18 m&#xE5;nader.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Statistical Office of Kosovo (SOK) have requested support from Sida and Statistics Sweden (SCB) in the areas of Economic statistics and IT. SCB has prepared a project document and they suggest that a timeframe for cooperation should be not less than four to five years. The proposal covers the first 18 months of the co-operation, but it also indicates what can be achieved in a long-term perspective.</narrative>
  </description>
